{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44936","headline":"妙喜寺高房期灵澈上人不至重招之一首 · 皎然","name":"妙喜寺高房期灵澈上人不至重招之一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨起峰顶心，怀人望空碧。\n扫雪开寺门，洒水净僧席。\n言笑形外阻，风仪想中觌。\n驰心惊叶动，倾耳闻泉滴。\n岂虑咆虎逢，乍疑崩湍隔。\n前期或不顾，知尔隳常格。\n如今谁山下，秋霖步淅沥。\n吾亦聊自得，行禅荷轻策。\n松声畅幽情，山意导遐迹。\n举目无世人，题诗足奇石。\n贫山何所有，特此邀来客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}